{"Smart feeding.\nMaximum yield.\nMinimal cost.": "Nyaachuu cimaa.\nOomisha guddaa.\nBaasii xiqqaa.", "Continue": "Itti fufi", "Email Address": "Teessoo Imeelii", "Enter PIN": "PIN galchi", "Proceed": "Itti fufi", "OR": "YOOKAAN", "New User? ": "Fayyadamaa haaraa? ", "Register here": "Asii galmaa'i", "Forgot PIN? ": "PIN dagatte? ", "Tap here": "Asii tuqi", "Reset Your PIN": "PIN kee jijjiiri", "Enter your registered email to receive a reset link": "Hidhata jijjiirraa argachuuf imeelii galmeessite galchi", "Create Account": "Akkaawuntii uumi", "Back": "Duuba", "Name": "Maqaa", "Country": "Biyya", "Loading countries...": "Biyyoota fe'aa jira...", "Select": "Filadhu", "Confirm PIN": "PIN mirkaneessi", "PINs do not match": "PINs walqixa miti", "Reset PIN": "PIN jijjiiri", "Sending...": "Erguu jira...", "Check Your Email": "Imeelii kee ilaali", "We've sent PIN reset instructions to your email address. Please check your inbox.": "Qajeelfama jijjiirraa PIN gara imeelii kee ergineerra. Maaloo saanduqa ergaa kee ilaali.", "Back to Login": "Gara seensaatti deebi'i", "Upgrade Your PIN": "PIN kee fooyyessi", "Time to upgrade your PIN": "Yeroon PIN kee fooyyessuu", "RationSmart now uses a 6-digit PIN for stronger security. Confirm your existing\n              4-digit PIN and pick a new 6-digit one.": "RationSmart amma nageenya cimaaf PIN dijiitii 6 fayyadama. PIN dijiitii 4 ammaa kee mirkaneessi fi haaraa dijiitii 6 filadhu.", "Current 4-digit PIN": "PIN dijiitii 4 ammaa", "New 6-digit PIN": "PIN dijiitii 6 haaraa", "Confirm New PIN": "PIN haaraa mirkaneessi", "New PINs do not match": "PINs haaraa walqixa miti", "Update PIN": "PIN haaromsi", "PIN Updated": "PIN haaromfame", "Your account now uses a 6-digit PIN. Please sign in with your new PIN.": "Akkaawuntiin kee amma PIN dijiitii 6 fayyadama. Maaloo PIN haaraa keetiin seenii.", "Sign In": "Seeni", "Verify Email": "Imeelii mirkaneessi", "We've sent a verification link to your email address. Tap the link to activate your\n          account, then sign in.": "Hidhata mirkaneeffannaa gara imeelii kee ergineerra. Akkaawuntii kee dammaqsuuf hidhata tuqi, ergasii seeni.", "Resend Verification Email": "Imeelii mirkaneeffannaa irra deebi'ii ergi", "Resending...": "Irra deebi'ee erguu jira...", "Continue to Login": "Gara seensaa itti fufi", "Terms & Conditions": "Sirroota fi Haalota", "Last updated: January 2025 · Digital Green Foundation": "Yeroo dhumaa haaromfame: Amajjii 2025 · Digital Green Foundation", "1. Acceptance of Terms": "1. Sirroota Fudhachuu", "By accessing and using RationSmart, you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms and Conditions. If you do not agree, please do not use the application.": "RationSmart fayyadamuun, sirroota fi haalota kanaan walii galta. Walii hin galtu yoo ta'e, maaloo aplikeeshinii kana hin fayyadamin.", "2. Use of Service": "2. Tajaajila Itti Fayyadamuu", "RationSmart is designed to assist livestock farmers and agricultural professionals in optimizing cattle feed formulation. The recommendations provided are based on scientific models and should be used as advisory information only.": "RationSmart qotee bulaa fi ogeessota qonnaa keessumeessa nyaata loonii sirreessuuf gargaaruuf qophaa'eera. Yaadni dhihaate sirna saayinsii irratti hundaa'a fi akka odeeffannoo gorsaatti qofa fayyadamuu qaba.", "3. Data Privacy": "3. Iccitii Daataa", "We collect and process data necessary to provide the feed formulation service. Your data is handled in accordance with applicable data protection laws. We do not sell your personal data to third parties.": "Tajaajila qopheessa nyaataa kennuuf daataa barbaachisu funaannee qopheessina. Daataan kee seera eegumsa daataa hojiirra oolu hordofeeti kan qabamu. Daataa dhuunfaa kee gara qaama sadaffaa hin gurgurru.", "4. Accuracy of Information": "4. Sirrina Odeeffannoo", "While we strive to provide accurate and up-to-date recommendations, Digital Green does not warrant that the information is complete, reliable, or suitable for any particular purpose. Consult a qualified veterinarian or nutritionist for critical decisions.": "Yaada sirrii fi haaraa kennuuf yaadu illee, Digital Green odeeffannoon guutuu, amanamaa yookin akeeka tokkoof mijataa ta'uu hin mirkaneessu. Murtii barbaachisaaf doktora horii yookin ogeessa nyaataa qulqulluu mariisisi.", "5. Account Responsibility": "5. Itti Gaafatamummaa Akkaawuntii", "You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials. You agree to notify us immediately of any unauthorized use of your account.": "Iccitii odeeffannoo akkaawuntii kee eeguu itti gaafatamta. Fayyadama akkaawuntii kee kan hin eeyyamamne battalaan akka nu beeksiftu walii galta.", "6. Intellectual Property": "6. Qabeenya Sammuu", "All content, logos, and software within RationSmart are the property of Digital Green Foundation. You may not reproduce or distribute any part of the service without written permission.": "Qabiyyeen, asxaan, fi softiweeriin RationSmart keessa jiran hundi qabeenya Digital Green Foundation ti. Hayyama barreeffamaan malee kutaa tajaajilaa kamiyyuu irra deebi'uu yookin raabsuu hin dandeessu.", "7. Limitation of Liability": "7. Daangaa Itti Gaafatamummaa", "Digital Green Foundation shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from use of RationSmart or reliance on its recommendations.": "Digital Green Foundation balaa kallattii hin taane, tasa, addaa, yookin hordoffii fayyadama RationSmart yookin yaadasaa irratti hirkachuu irraa dhalatuuf itti gaafatamaa hin ta'u.", "8. Changes to Terms": "8. Jijjiirama Sirroota", "We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Continued use of the application after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated terms.": "Yeroo kamiyyuu sirroota kana jijjiiruuf mirga qabna. Jijjiirama booda fayyadama aplikeeshinii itti fufuun sirroota haaromfaman fudhatamuu agarsiisa.", "9. Contact": "9. Walqunnamtii", "For questions about these Terms and Conditions, ple